.TH turegistry n 0.1 tclutils
.SH tclutils::turegistry
.PP
A small keyed value registry (service locator / bag). Store values under keys and fetch them with a required\-get that errors on a missing key.
.SS API
.CS
set reg [::tclutils::turegistry::create]
::tclutils::turegistry::put $reg db $conn
::tclutils::turegistry::get $reg db            ;# -> $conn
::tclutils::turegistry::get $reg cache {}       ;# -> "" (default)
.CE
.PP
Commands:
.IP \(bu
\fBcreate\fR → registry token.
.IP \(bu
\fBput reg key value\fR → value.
.IP \(bu
\fBget reg key ?default?\fR — missing key errors \fB{TCLUTILS TUREGISTRY KEY}\fR unless a default is supplied.
.IP \(bu
\fBhas reg key\fR, \fBkeys reg ?pattern?\fR, \fBremove reg key\fR, \fBdestroy reg\fR.
